   "text": "The operational definition and reliable measurement of 'adhering to a suppression-conditional recommended mix' are complex and not fully established. Inconsistent or noisy measurement could obscure any true effect."
  },
  {
   "code": "EXPOSURE_SPARSITY",
   "text": "If 'suppression-conditional recommended mixes' are rare or only apply in very specific game situations, the exposure to the treatment condition might be sparse, limiting the data available for analysis."
  }
 ],
